 fantasy-like beings, and they kill many of the citizens of Tokyo. This event is known as the Ginza Incident.\n\nThe government sends a small group of soldiers from the Japanese Self-Defense Forces (a replacement for Japan's military) to the alternate world beyond the gate. Led by otaku soldier Youji, they find that the villages in the world are being attacked by a dragon. An elf girl who is a survivor from the dragon's rampage joins the group in their travels across the dangerous new world.\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)"},"tags":[{"name":"Military","rank":98,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Isekai","rank":92,"spoiler":false},{"name":"War","rank":88,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Alternate Universe","rank":84,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Politics","rank":83,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Adult Cast","rank":72,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Reverse Isekai","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Female Cast","rank":68,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Magic","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Anachronism","rank":65,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Dragons","rank":64,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tanks","rank":62,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Elf","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Medieval","rank":56,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Language Barrier","rank":55,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Otaku Culture","rank":52,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Kemonomimi","rank":35,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Slavery","rank":31,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Aviation","rank":30,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Kuudere","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Harem","rank":20,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Gate","english":"Gate","native":"GATE 自衛隊 彼の地にて、斯く戦えり","romaji":"GATE: Jieitai Kanochi nite, Kaku Tatakaeri","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"GATE 奇幻自卫队"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"GATE（ゲート） 自衛隊 彼の地にて、斯く戦えり"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"ゲート―自衛隊 彼の地にて、斯く戦えり"}]},"trailer":{"id":"IulCg2hnu54","site":"youtube","thumbnail